# Craft App Suite apps installed for every user at first login by
# first-login.sh (step artcraft-apps), as user Flatpak bundles from each
# app's latest GitHub release, exactly as ArtCraft Launcher installs them on
# image-based systems. The launcher detects them and manages their updates.
# Home Edition carries the office apps and the photo editors; the rest of
# the suite is one click away in ArtCraft Launcher.
# Format: <id> <flatpak app id> <GitHub repo>
wordcraft       ai.storyteller.wordcraft         storytold/wordcraft
gridcraft       ai.storyteller.gridcraft         storytold/gridcraft
deckcraft       ai.storyteller.deckcraft         storytold/deckcraft
pdfcraft        ai.storyteller.pdfcraft          storytold/pdfcraft
photocraft      ai.storyteller.photocraft        storytold/photocraft
lightcraft      ai.storyteller.lightcraft        storytold/lightcraft
